-bust-on-a-pedestal-WYBCYND.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/antique-style-roman-or-grecian-bust-on-a-pedestal-WYBCYND.jpg 1052w, http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/antique-style-roman-or-grecian-bust-on-a-pedestal-WYBCYND-239x300.jpg 239w, http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/antique-style-roman-or-grecian-bust-on-a-pedestal-WYBCYND-816x1024.jpg 816w, http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/antique-style-roman-or-grecian-bust-on-a-pedestal-WYBCYND-768x964.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1052px) 100vw, 1052px\" />																<h2>Potted Aroid Palm</h2>		<p>Figma Design</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Testimonial\n					</a>\n									<h2>What People Says About <br> My Work</h2>															<img width=\"88\" height=\"17\" src=\"http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hero-shape-1-1.png\" alt=\"\" />																		\n															<img width=\"158\" height=\"163\" src=\"http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/cllient-1.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n									<p>Working with this architectural firm was an excellent experience from start to finish. They took the time to understand our vision and transformed it into a design that was both beautiful and practical. Their attention to detail and professionalism truly stood out throughout the entire project.</p>								\n					<h2>Clairre Issabella</h2>				\n									<p>Property Developer</p>								\n															<img width=\"158\" height=\"163\" src=\"http://portfolio-website.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/cllient-1.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n									<p>Working with this architectural firm was an excellent experience from start to finish. They took the time to understand our vision and transformed it into a design that was both beautiful and practical. Their attention to detail and professionalism truly stood out throughout the entire project.</p>								